# Import Discipline

- Read `docs-governance/archive/IMPORT_DISCIPLINE_MATRIX.md` (archived — reference only) before introducing new cross-module imports.
- `views` may not import execution-plane internals.
- execution-plane code may not import domain modules directly.
- `storage` may not import UI, prompt, or policy logic.
- `shell` should depend on contracts and adapters, not direct domain mutation handlers.
